cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these gates or cite a verdict from them, cite this reference implementation."
title: "memory-gate-suite: the MGP-1.0 reference implementation of memory quality gates"
abstract: >-
  Six deterministic-first gates that judge AI memory stores on erasure
  re-materialisation, retrieval influence, staleness, write-path trust,
  lossless handoff, and the evidence-class of published quality claims.
  Verdicts are machine-checkable: four states with invalid taking precedence,
  first-class abstention, mandatory epistemic class per layer, reproducible
  samples for every failure, and a hash-chained operation ledger.
version: 1.0.0
